{"id": 85, "name": "Dyrroth", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ce1031d6d4e49f33719bd3d833a9b45b.png", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Charge", "Burst"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["50", "50", "20", "40"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", "Jungle"], "story": "Once a noble prince of the Moniyan Empire, he was abducted by Alice, the Queen of the Blood Demons, and transformed into the Prince of the Abyss.", "skills": [{"name": "Wrath of the Abyss", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_ae1fdb44e6ccbe768170c1200dc1bb5a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "When Dyrroth's Rage reaches 50%, he enhances <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Burst Strike</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Spectre Step</span>.\n\nAfter every 2 Basic Attacks, Dyrroth releases a Circle Strike, dealing <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+150% Total Physical Attack)</span> - <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+180% Total Physical Attack)</span> (scales with level) <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the circle and recovering <span style=\"color:#26e407\"> 7%</span> - <span style=\"color:#26e407\"> 10%</span> <span style=\"color:#26e407\">Max HP</span> (scales with level, halved against minions). This strike does not trigger Attack Effect.\nEach time he damages an enemy, the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Burst Strike</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Spectre Step</span> is reduced by 1s.\n\nDyrroth recovers 2% - 5% Rage per second (scales with level)."}, {"name": "Burst Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_7e6352d703b1c9ab808bc391f343442d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6", "desc": "Dyrroth releases a burst strike in a designated direction. Each burst deals 240<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies and slows them by 25% for 1.5s. (The damage decays against the same target and decreases to only 75% on minions.)\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyss Enhanced</span>: Burst Strike has a longer range, deals 140% of the original damage, and its Slowing Effect is doubled."}, {"name": "Spectre Step", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_79b3c08cdec6752a445d5d633c65c8eb.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6", "desc": "Dyrroth dashes in the designated direction. He will stop when he has traveled the max distance or hits one enemy hero or a Creep, dealing 230<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+60% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the target and slightly knocking them back. When he uses this skill again, he will lock onto a target and release a Fatal Strike, dealing 345<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+120% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and reducing the target's Physical Defense by 40% for 4s.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Abyss Enhanced</span>: Fatal Strike will reach further and deal 150% of the original damage, slow the target by an extra 90% and reduce the target's Physical Defense by 60% for 4s."}, {"name": "Abysm Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18/100_15bf420f66a913f48b468b5830bd709a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 36", "desc": "After a short delay, Dyrroth launches a destructive strike in the target direction (this skill can only be interrupted by Suppression), dealing 650<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+250% Extra Physical Attack)</span> plus 20% of the target's lost HP as <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in its path, and slowing them by 55% for 0.8s. This skill deals up to 1500 damage to non-hero enemies."}], "builds": [{"lane": "EXP", "winRate": 59.6, "pickRate": 0.89, "spell": {"name": "Vengeance", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b9bccc6a8b4634cf64ef2829d72dba85.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Fighter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2153bf01770633e3251dea1f2ac6c956.png", "attrs": ["+10% Spell Vamp", "+22 Adaptive Attack", "+6 Extra Physical Defense", "+6 Extra Magic Defense"]}, "items": [{"name": "War Axe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_fa1f5745cf88227722a9ff22c95c0bc4.png"}, {"name": "Queen's Wings", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f6bab0819a3203e65eb28da7ef1c4478.png"}, {"name": "Oracle", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bc24b55abbbec6da408eb0ea5c37cad4.png"}]}, {"lane": "JUNGLE", "winRate": 58.4, "pickRate": 3.4, "spell": {"name": "Retribution", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2cd084a2661c121c347facb060a80377.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Assassin", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ae89ce5b37dcd804686133c8d7044430.png", "attrs": ["+14 Adaptive Penetration", "+10 Adaptive Attack", "+3% Movement Speed"]}, "items": [{"name": "War Axe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_fa1f5745cf88227722a9ff22c95c0bc4.png"}, {"name": "Rose Gold Meteor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_da94005b9d67024c8f189889ba6368cb.png"}, {"name": "Hunter Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/home